# Byte-for-byte parity with the VPS deployment is a release gate:
#   sha256(local file) == sha256(/opt/fcp-node/<same file>)
# is how we verify that the running server matches this tree. The global
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite LF to CRLF on the next checkout and silently
# break that comparison, so disable all EOL conversion for this repository.
* -text
